  "title": "kerberos: Fix unwanted overflow in get_krb_pdu_len",
  "description": "get_krb_pdu_len returns an unsigned length; don't do signed\ninteger arithmetic and overflow, especially since the value\nnever needs to overflow an unsigned integer. (The record\nlength, which doesn't include the header, is no bigger than\nINT_MAX.)",
